---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="DCS Automation — Abhinav">
  <article class="case-study">

    <a class="back-link" href="/projects/">
      ← Projects
    </a>

    <header class="case-hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">
        MACHINE LEARNING · AUTOMATION
      </span>

      <h1>DCS Automation</h1>

      <p class="case-intro">
        Automating a complex manual item-classification workflow
        using machine learning and optimization.
      </p>

      <div class="case-metrics">
        <div>
          <strong>7d → 1d</strong>
          <span>Workflow duration</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>~3%</strong>
          <span>Profit uplift</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>ML</strong>
          <span>Production pipeline</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="case-section">
      <span>01</span>

      <div>
        <h2>The Problem</h2>

        <p>
          The existing DCS item-slotting process required substantial
          manual analysis and could take approximately seven days to
          complete.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-section">
      <span>02</span>

      <div>
        <h2>Problem Framing</h2>

        <p>
          Instead of treating the workflow as simple text matching,
          the problem was framed as supervised product classification
          with optimization around feature representation and model
          parameters.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-section">
      <span>03</span>

      <div>
        <h2>Approach</h2>

        <ul>
          <li>TF-IDF feature engineering</li>
          <li>N-gram text representation</li>
          <li>Multinomial Naive Bayes</li>
          <li>Optuna hyperparameter optimization</li>
          <li>Automated preprocessing and validation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-section">
      <span>04</span>

      <div>
        <h2>Impact</h2>

        <p>
          The automated workflow reduced the analysis cycle from
          approximately seven days to roughly one day while improving
          consistency and scalability.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="next-project">
      <span>Next case study</span>

      <a href="/projects/product-similarity/">
        Product Similarity Detection →
      </a>
    </section>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>
